---
---
<header class="top">
  <a class="mark" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>designing-with-taste</a>
  <a class="gh" href="https://github.com/Anjalisinggh/designing-with-taste">GitHub</a>
</header>
<div class="hero">
  <h1>Which page was made with taste?</h1>
  <div class="hero-text">
    <p class="lede">An agent skill that keeps AI-built interfaces from looking like every other AI-built interface.</p>
    <p class="sub">We gave an agent the same prompt twice: once with this skill, once without. Tea tasters grade cups without knowing which estate they came from. Do the same here, then see which one used the skill.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 0; }
  .mark { font: 800 20px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .gh { font-weight: 700; }
  .hero { padding: 28px 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px 56px; align-items: end; }
  .hero-text { padding-bottom: 6px; }
  h1 { font: 800 clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px)/.98 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.025em; margin: 0; max-width: 12ch; }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
